./ I 00044000 $ 00044100 010                                                    
*  ESA/390 OPERATION REQUEST BLOCK AND INTERRUPTION RESPONSE   XA0003DK         
*  BLOCK, ONE PER OUTSTANDING OPERATION. DMKIOS IS REENTRANT   XA0003DK         
*  AND NEVER DISABLES -- IT HAS NO STNSM, STOSM OR SSM         XA0003DK         
*  ANYWHERE -- SO THESE CANNOT BE A SHARED WORK AREA. MAPPED   XA0003DK         
*  WITH ORBLOK AND IRBLOK IN XABLOKS. THE IRB IS SIXTY-FOUR    XA0003DK         
*  BYTES BECAUSE TSCH ALWAYS STORES ALL SIXTY-FOUR, EVEN       XA0003DK         
*  THOUGH M1 READS ONLY THE SCSW.                              XA0003DK         
IOBORB   DS    XL32           ORB -- MAP WITH ORBLOK           XA0003DK         
IOBIRB   DS    XL64           IRB -- MAP WITH IRBLOK           XA0003DK         
